# Call the Spirit Dragons: "Dragons you control", "a Dragon you control of that color". Bot1 controls no Dragon, so its upkeep puts no
# counter anywhere and asks nothing; Bot2's Flock Impostor (a white changeling Dragon) gets none, stays a 2/2, and has no indestructible:
# Bot1's Lightning Bolt kills it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Call the Spirit Dragons
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Flock Impostor
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Call the Spirit Dragons.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Flock Impostor.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Flock Impostor.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Flock Impostor)

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Flock Impostor
